{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moondark is a survival horror hunting game where you're stranded in an open-world forest at night. Main focus of the game is on exploration, non-linear gameplay, and atmosphere.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Atmospheric horror focuses on building tension through mood, environment, and sound rather than jump scares or constant action. In Moondark, the eerie forest, haunting sounds, and sense of isolation create a slow, creeping dread that keeps players on edge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras/608dda6c30c73dee403d14acf628c6a3.avif?t=1753709162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras_big/608dda6c30c73dee403d14acf628c6a3.avif?t=1753709162 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Moondark, you'll gather supplies, avoid danger, and carefully plan your actions to outlast the forest and the beast that stalks you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras/d04023da0e709aa97dd07ada1213ac8a.avif?t=1753709162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras_big/d04023da0e709aa97dd07ada1213ac8a.avif?t=1753709162 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover The Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore hidden paths, abandoned sites, and mysterious landmarks as you uncover the secrets of the dark forest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras/5c1a1512fdbced14394bc923efcc97ef.avif?t=1753709162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras_big/5c1a1512fdbced14394bc923efcc97ef.avif?t=1753709162 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 Handcrafted environments</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 Randomized placement of loot</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 Non-linear gameplay</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 No hand holding</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 Suspenseful atmosphere</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676750?t=1753709162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676750?t=1753709162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/efb2cc73cf2380fabd50782213945472e02e1453/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753709162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/efb2cc73cf2380fabd50782213945472e02e1453/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753709162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moondark is a survival horror hunting game where you're stranded in an open-world forest at night. Main focus of the game is on exploration, non-linear gameplay, and atmosphere.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Atmospheric horror focuses on building tension through mood, environment, and sound rather than jump scares or constant action. In Moondark, the eerie forest, haunting sounds, and sense of isolation create a s